        "quote": "(a) During the term of the franchise grant and during such time as the grantee is providing service pursuant to such grant, there shall be on file with the City Clerk an insurance policy, approved as to form and endorsed by the City Attorney, providing liability coverage for each and every ambulance owned, operated or leased by the grantee.",
