          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 940,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.25.140:block:1",
          "start": 343
        },
        "quote": "(b) Minimum coverage of the insurance policy required by this section shall be in the amounts of $1,000,000 for any one person killed or injured in any one accident or occurrence and $2,000,000 for more than one person injured or killed in any one accident or occurrence, with passenger or patient hazard included in the policy. Such policy shall also provide a minimum coverage of $100,000 for all damages arising out of injury to or destruction of property. Each insurance policy shall include medical professional liability insurance in a minimum amount of $1,000,000. (Ord. 20557 § 5, 4-8-25.)",
